s accept sync or async implementations, except\n",[504,825,826],{},"webhookCalls.process",", which returns a promise.",[720,829,831],{"id":830},"billables-and-bindings","Billables and bindings",[493,833,834,835,838,839,842,843,846,847,850,851,854,855,858,859,861],{},"Keep your user, team, or organization as the billable; there is no ",[504,836,837],{},"Billable"," mixin.\n",[504,840,841],{},"CustomerProfile"," carries ",[504,844,845],{},"vatlyId",", ",[504,848,849],{},"email",", and optional ",[504,852,853],{},"name",". Your application's\nID (",[504,856,857],{},"hostId",") is separate from Vatly's customer ID (",[504,860,845],{},"). Authorize both.",[742,863,864,877],{},[745,865,866],{},[748,867,868,874],{},[751,869,870,873],{},[504,871,872],{},"CustomerBindings"," method",[751,875,876],{},"Behavior",[758,878,879,889,899,909],{},[748,880,881,886],{},[763,882,883],{},[504,884,885],{},"bind(vatlyId, hostId)",[763,887,888],{},"Associate IDs atomically; enforce uniqueness on both sides.",[748,890,891,896],{},[763,892,893],{},[504,894,895],{},"record(vatlyId)",[763,897,898],{},"Record an unattributed customer without clearing an existing binding.",[748,900,901,906],{},[763,902,903],{},[504,904,905],{},"vatlyCustomerIdFor(hostId)",[763,907,908],{},"Return the Vatly ID or null.",[748,910,911,916],{},[763,912,913],{},[504,914,915],{},"hostCustomerIdFor(vatlyId)",[763,917,918],{},"Return the host ID or null.",[493,920,921,922,926],{},"Do not silently reassign bindings. Keep test and live data separate. See\n",[923,924,925],"a",{"href":319},"customers"," for creation and lookup examples.",[720,928,930],{"id":929},"webhook-storage","Webhook storage",[493,932,933,934,937,938,941,942,946],{},"Wire ",[504,935,936],{},"webhookCalls"," for deduplication and audit retention, and ",[504,939,940],{},"events"," for outbox\nwrites. They must share a transaction with repositories and bindings. Use your\ndatabase's transaction context or request-scoped drivers, not a global variable\nsha